{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "161", "x": 0.8997849334044037, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03395831519923213, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "website, of course, and volunteers are asked to help by making sure", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12378835115115883, "w": 0.7715220639339461, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "residents know about it. It's updated every day with information about future", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.15211877666808146, "w": 0.7717396218859198, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "activities and we want as many people as possible to use it.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.1804491267422191, "w": 0.609932945604463, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Go on to some practical matters. As you probably know, the town arranges", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.20877947681635672, "w": 0.7714346101483506, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "three major festivals every year and they all depend on a large number of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23710982689049434, "w": 0.7712607278266975, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "volunteers. The book festival lasts three days and uses several venues which", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2652919318920643, "w": 0.7719258072020294, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "all need volunteers. More are needed for the music festival because that", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2936593243736476, "w": 0.7713698143775459, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "lasts a whole week and even more help is required for the science festival", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.321989731029874, "w": 0.7714567555383723, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "even though it's only 2 days long. It involves quite a lot of venues though. It's", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3503200811040116, "w": 0.7721986261041041, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a good idea to help at the festival you're most interested in because you can", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3786504311781492, "w": 0.7716962538304605, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "attend most of the events for free. We try", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4069808189736794, "w": 0.4314911342058822, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to use volunteers who are flexible though because some festival events are", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4353112067692095, "w": 0.7714349177232119, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "held outdoors and the weather may affect the size of the audience and even", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4636415568433471, "w": 0.7720655487140654, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "whether the event can take place. So there can be changes at short notice.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4919966521509719, "w": 0.7713914471427987, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "What's essential though is being able to get on well with other people and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.520327039946502, "w": 0.7714783883036251, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "also to deal with someone who's behaving badly, as occasionally happens.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5486573900206396, "w": 0.7714566530134186, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Our plan is to get your work in in September after a week's training starting", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5769877778161697, "w": 0.7715442093239678, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "on the 2nd. So, we'll be timetabling you for duties the following week from", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6053181278903074, "w": 0.7714783883036251, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the 9th onward. Later in the week beginning September 23rd, we have a chat", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.633648477964445, "w": 0.7716744160153, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "with each of you to find out how you feel about being a volunteer and what", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6620160213315983, "w": 0.7719805555273612, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "extra support you need. As a thank Thank you to the volunteers. We arranged", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6903462959629509, "w": 0.7716089025698187, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "an annual event. In recent years, we've had a party in the town hall and last", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7186767214798736, "w": 0.7714786958784866, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "year a barbecue in Chamber Park. Our fourthcoming event is a trip along the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7468587510386585, "w": 0.772151874725169, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "canal from here to Duehurst and back. It's on Saturday, September the 28th.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7751891011127962, "w": 0.7716743134903462, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "And if you'd like to attend, you can sign up once you start work. Now, this is", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8035195266297188, "w": 0.7713258311723636, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the volunteers t-shirt.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8318498767038565, "w": 0.2252490664334019, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 3", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8891286795898146, "w": 0.07405254383377506, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}